OL,3,GNEWSAFirm pledges 'full investigation'
OL,4,Ainto bus crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "full investigation" will be
OL,7,Fconducted into how and why a bus
OL,8,Fcrashed into a building in Leeds city
OL,9,Fcentre, its operator has said.
OL,11,FSix passengers suffered minor injuries
OL,12,Fwhen the bus crashed into The Light
OL,13,Fleisure complex on Albion Street at
OL,14,Fabout 16:35 GMT on Monday.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for First Bus said a
OL,17,Fparked car was also damaged by the
OL,18,Fvehicle, one of its route five buses,
OL,19,Fand confirmed the company was helping
OL,20,Fpolice with their inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
